      "supports": "Boadicea 1861",
      "quote": "the British bark Boadicea , headed for Glasgow, Scotland, crashed into Halfway Rock so unexpectedly and hard that all aboard drowned"
    },
    {
      "cite": 2,
      "supports": "tower interior",
      "quote": "A kitchen was located on the first floor, the principal keeper lived on the second floor, the two assistants on a third level"
    },
